Value Required INTERFACE (GigabitEthernet\s+\S+)
Value ADMIN_STATE (\S+)
Value MTU (\d+)
Value SPEED (\S+)
Value DUPLEX (\S+)
Value AUTONEG (\S+)
Value STATS_INTERVAL (\d+)
Value INPUT_PACKETS (\d+)
Value INPUT_BYTES (\d+)
Value INPUT_MULTICAST (\d+)
Value INPUT_BROADCAST (\d+)
Value CRC_ERRORS (\d+)
Value FRAGMENTS (\d+)
Value DROPPED_PACKETS (\d+)
Value RUNTS (\d+)
Value GIANTS (\d+)
Value TOTAL_ERRORS (\d+)
Value LINK_STATE (\S+)

Start
  ^GigabitEthernet\s+\S+\s+Status: -> Continue.Record
  ^${INTERFACE}\s+Status:
  ^Driver Configuration Block: Admin State ${ADMIN_STATE} MTU ${MTU} Speed ${SPEED} Duplex ${DUPLEX} Autoneg ${AUTONEG} Stats Interval ${STATS_INTERVAL}
  ^Input packet count\s+${INPUT_PACKETS}
  ^Input bytes count\s+${INPUT_BYTES}
  ^Input mcast packets\s+${INPUT_MULTICAST}
  ^Input bcast packets\s+${INPUT_BROADCAST}
  ^Input CRC packets\s+${CRC_ERRORS}
  ^Input fragment packets\s+${FRAGMENTS}
  ^Dropped packets\s+${DROPPED_PACKETS}
  ^Runt packets\s+${RUNTS}
  ^Giant packets count\s+${GIANTS}
  ^Total error packet count\s+${TOTAL_ERRORS}
  ^PCS Status: Link State \[${LINK_STATE}\]
